      "title": "mktime_utc(): handle 1969-12-31 23:59:59.",
      "message": "mktime_utc(): handle 1969-12-31 23:59:59.\n\n-1 as an error return thas the problem that it's a *non*-error return\nvalue for 1969-12-31 23:59:59.\n\nHave mktime_utc() return -1 and set errno to EINVAL iff an error\noccurred.  Otherwise, set errno to 0, so a return value of -1 and* errno\nset to EINVAL means an error occurred.\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "authored_date": "2023-09-06T02:00:11.000-07:00",
